1 Introduction
The rise in the use of simulators in the context of autonomous driving is mainly due to the need for prototyping and exhaustive validation, since the tests of autonomous systems directly on real scenarios alone are not capable of providing suﬃcient evidence that prove its safety [1]. There is some initial consensus
